{
    "id":  26463,
    "lang":  "en",
    "name":  "Solar LED Floodlight EcoLite 40 1200Lm 3CCT | PIR Sensor + Remote Control | IP65",
    "reference":  "FLSS40W-3CCT-91560",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eEcoLite 40W Solar LED Floodlight\u003c/strong\u003e offers powerful, efficient outdoor lighting up to \u003cstrong\u003e1200 lumens\u003c/strong\u003e thanks to its high-brightness SMD LEDs and \u003cstrong\u003eselectable 3CCT system (3000K / 4000K / 6500K)\u003c/strong\u003e. Incorporates \u003cstrong\u003ePIR motion sensor\u003c/strong\u003e with up to 3 meters detection and \u003cstrong\u003eremote control\u003c/strong\u003e. \u003cstrong\u003e4W 5V monocrystalline solar panel\u003c/strong\u003e and \u003cstrong\u003e4,000 mAh 3.2V lithium battery\u003c/strong\u003e. Made of \u003cstrong\u003eresistant ABS\u003c/strong\u003e with \u003cstrong\u003eIP65 protection\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003eEcoLite 40 1200Lm Solar LED Floodlight Selectable 3CCT (3000K / 4000K / 6500K)\u0026nbsp;| PIR Sensor + Remote Control | IP65\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eEcoLite 40W Solar LED Floodlight\u003c/strong\u003e is an efficient, modern and sustainable outdoor lighting solution, designed to deliver high performance with zero energy consumption. Equipped with \u003cstrong\u003ehigh-brightness SMD\u003c/strong\u003e LEDs and \u003cstrong\u003eselectable 3CCT technology (3000K / 4000K / 6500K)\u003c/strong\u003e, it lets you choose between warm, neutral or cool light depending on the ambience and lighting needs. With up to \u003cstrong\u003e1200 lumens\u003c/strong\u003e, it is ideal for illuminating gardens, patios, terraces, entrances, plots, pathways and all kinds of outdoor areas.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThis solar LED floodlight features a practical \u003cstrong\u003ePIR motion sensor\u003c/strong\u003e with a detection range of up to \u003cstrong\u003e3 metres\u003c/strong\u003e, optimising energy savings and improving outdoor security. It also includes a \u003cstrong\u003eremote control\u003c/strong\u003e, making it easy to configure different operating modes, light intensity and energy-saving options quickly and conveniently.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThanks to its efficient \u003cstrong\u003e4W 5V monocrystalline solar panel\u003c/strong\u003e and rechargeable \u003cstrong\u003e4,000 mAh (3.2V)\u003c/strong\u003e lithium battery, the EcoLite 40W provides up to \u003cstrong\u003e12 hours of autonomy\u003c/strong\u003e without any electrical connection. Its solar-powered operation helps reduce electricity consumption and promotes more ecological and sustainable lighting.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBuilt with \u003cstrong\u003ehigh-resistance ABS\u003c/strong\u003e and featuring \u003cstrong\u003eIP65 waterproof and dustproof\u003c/strong\u003e protection, this solar LED floodlight is ready to withstand rain, humidity, dust and adverse weather conditions, guaranteeing maximum durability and outdoor performance all year round.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eEcoLite 40W\u003c/strong\u003e is perfect for use in:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\nGardens and patios\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\nHome entrances and garages\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\nPlots and estates\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\nPaths and walkways\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\nTerraces and balconies\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\nOutdoor security lighting\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\nAreas without access to the electricity grid\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eA practical, efficient and easy-to-install option for those looking for a \u003cstrong\u003epowerful, durable and low-consumption outdoor solar LED floodlight\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\n\n\u003c/p\u003e",
